    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> A creature is in your spotlight</p><hr><p>You immediately manifest a hologram horror that appears in front of your foe with no warning. You attempt to [[/act demoralize]] the target in your spotlight, using Performance instead of Intimidation and ignoring the usual range of 30 feet. This check doesn't take a penalty if the target doesn't share a language with you.</p><hr><p><strong>Special</strong> If you or the target has the horror or pressure roles, you can Demoralize the target even if they are temporarily immune to your attempts to Demoralize them.</p>",
